diff --git a/docs/utils.rst b/docs/utils.rst
index 995c171..f941d00 100644
--- a/docs/utils.rst
+++ b/docs/utils.rst
@@ -217,6 +217,10 @@ Example usage::
     import click
     click.edit(filename='/etc/passwd')
 
+Pass ``editor_args`` to add literal arguments between the configured editor
+command and the filename. The iterable is consumed once, and each argument
+keeps its own command-line boundary in both direct and temporary-text modes.
+
 
 Launching Applications
 ----------------------
